{"screen_name": "sakurayahonpo", "file": "sakurayahonpo", "name": "桜屋🔞", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2001112407540948992/OF4HvD97.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/122748889/1716713238/1500x500", "description": "skeb始めました、よしなに http://skeb.jp/@sakurayahonpo \npatreon http://patreon.com/boundofdragon \nまとめmin.t https://min.togetter.com/id/sakurayahonpo\n❌作品の転載･加工・AI学習禁止", "total_works": 16, "scraped_works": 16, "first_seen": "2026-02-16T18:09:12.278019+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-20T00:19:35.610669+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-16T18:09:12.278019+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/sakurayahonpo", "name": "sakurayahonpo"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "http://patreon.com/boundofdragon", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/597691", "name": "597691"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@sakurayahonpo/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a8980fe7/uploads/origins/427e7d08-2858-458e-be3e-e18e8a2a9a00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=449205b342be13eacd8cac318de091dc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a8980fe7/uploads/origins/427e7d08-2858-458e-be3e-e18e8a2a9a00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=449205b342be13eacd8cac318de091dc, https://si.imgix.net/a8980fe7/uploads/origins/427e7d08-2858-458e-be3e-e18e8a2a9a00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fa6ae2b7e3df508140b888b926c3259 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a8980fe7/uploads/origins/427e7d08-2858-458e-be3e-e18e8a2a9a00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=680d063d7df9b4556094d7067093b43c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "RPGの世界では。\n\n顔を紅潮させた魅惑のステータス下の筋骨隆々の拳闘家で、たるんだタマと勃起して先走り汁を漏らす二重チンポを持つ。胸筋と腹筋を露出した服を着ており、乳輪と指なし手袋を装備している。\n\nシチュエーションによっては、鼻輪やコックリングが似合うと思えば自由に付けてもいい。\n\n\n参考シート：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nQcyYrVWFvyXypRJUJgbd2n6Dqz1datW?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakurayahonpo/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd9a7880/uploads/origins/6bb8ecdb-af92-4333-b0c5-1146d42de8b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b829cb1231ec3488d9b895d11be9a7ee", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd9a7880/uploads/origins/6bb8ecdb-af92-4333-b0c5-1146d42de8b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b829cb1231ec3488d9b895d11be9a7ee, https://si.imgix.net/cd9a7880/uploads/origins/6bb8ecdb-af92-4333-b0c5-1146d42de8b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b013b313d8dfd46c4f313de162fc68ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd9a7880/uploads/origins/6bb8ecdb-af92-4333-b0c5-1146d42de8b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c8f5233393da1ad461b30f91b61f98e0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakurayahonpo/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b0fef0/uploads/origins/ccc51755-7d0c-4956-bd5a-bb1c234fd13e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c859246ec9e191d57d7e84f3ae781793", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b0fef0/uploads/origins/ccc51755-7d0c-4956-bd5a-bb1c234fd13e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&f